{"timestamp":"2026-11-03T19:20:20.127Z","ordinal":78246,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a1a2da-f19e-7aa2-9a4f-59d0cfd3aac9","call_id":"call_ae0861c83b744ff9ad3c497417988a2a","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"[{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_search__work_state_read\",\"description\":\"Read this project's to-do lists and working state written with work_state_write: every open item, or one list, with done and dropped items when includeClosed is true. Params: list, includeClosed. This tool is part of plugin `claude-mem`.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_search__work_state_read(args: {\\n  // Also show done and dropped items and closed lists\\n  includeClosed?: boolean;\\n  // Read only this list\\n  list?: string;\\n}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_search__work_state_write\",\"description\":\"Your canonical to-do list and working state for this project, kept across sessions: whatever is still open is shown at the start of every session. Each call appends one entry to a list. To-do item: fields {\\\"task\\\": \\\"<name>\\\", \\\"status\\\": \\\"todo\\\" | \\\"doing\\\" | \\\"done\\\" | \\\"dropped\\\", ...details}. State on the list itself: any other fields (the latest value of each key wins; null clears a key; \\\"status\\\": \\\"done\\\" closes the list). Returns what is still open in the list. Params: list (required), fields (required). This tool is part of plugin `claude-mem`.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_search__work_state_write(args: {\\n  // Keys to set. Include \\\"task\\\" to update a to-do item. Values are strings, numbers, booleans, or null to clear a key.\\n  fields: { [key: string]: string | number | boolean | null; };\\n  // The to-do list or tracked thing this entry belongs to, e.g. \\\"release\\\" or \\\"auth-refactor\\\"\\n  list: string;\\n}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };\\n```\"}]"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","create_time":1793733620.1269176}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
