ator integration (commit=05c49df2, 2a94f62e, test_evidence=Full npm test: 2138 tests, 2136 pass, 0 fail, 2 skipped; scope measurement fixtures passed; log SHA-256 19aeb576f3be4f45b7507d79a0a1cfda1a46e9caebca59f87de9e60b17bf5a16, type_gate=npm run build passed, review=APPROVED by /root/review_delta on both commits, claim_release=9 WP-1104-specific file claims released; WP-1103 shared claims retained, work_product=/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-integration), updated about 33 hours ago\n  - [done] V112 release scope reconciliation (work_product=/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-scope-reconciliation/docs/releases/v1.1.2.md, details=Commit 4b63cee0 on v1/v112-scope-reconciliation. Corrected docs/releases/v1.1.2.md to reflect user-selected full WP-1101..WP-1108 roadmap, failed/unpublished v1.1.0 and published v1.1.1 predecessor, and explicitly incomplete implementation/qualification. Scope assertions and git diff --check pass; independent review_delta APPROVED. Push/tag/publish remain owner actions.), updated about 31 hours ago\n  - [doing] WP-1105 contained code evaluators (phase=FULL SUITE / WP-1105, gate=Focused 18/18 evaluator tests PASS; package runtime inventory 2 PASS, 3 skipped; npm run build PASS; exact full npm test still active and has mid-run failures, final summary pending, next=Wait for full npm test and terminal-acceptance process to exit; then capture final result, release SUITE claim, compare failures on pristine base, friction=Exact suite elapsed 25m and remains active; observed failures include Core RPC disconnect, safety/REPL and verifier cases, with no causal diagnosis yet, heartbeat=2026-11-03 current turn; polling active suite session 6654), updated about 16 hours ago\n  - [doing] WP-1105 full suite exact source head (phase=Full suite active in worktree v112-wp1105-hardening; session 83873, gate=Current corrected npm test run ongoing; no final tally yet. Earlier failures before proper CARGO_HOME/RUSTUP_HOME explicit exports are superseded., next=Poll sessio