:48Z RELEASE SUITE owner=codex-root branch=v1/v112-wp1101-integration result=RC2 terminal process-scope acceptance PASS; log /tmp/v112-rc2-terminal-scope.log; make build PASS including tsc and exact binary reports 1.1.2-rc.2\n2026-11-03T17:26:29Z CLAIM SUITE owner=codex-root branch=v1/v112-wp1101-integration scope=RC2 updated qualification record and version diff hygiene/security checks\n2026-11-03T17:26:49Z RELEASE SUITE owner=codex-root branch=v1/v112-wp1101-integration result=RC2 updated-document security gates PASS; npm audit and cargo advisories/licenses clean, credential scan clean, diff hygiene clean, documentation identifiers clean\n2026-11-03T17:28:01Z CLAIM FILE_cli_src_ceri_runner.ts owner=codex-root branch=v1/v112-wp1101-integration scope=WP-1105 RC2 provenance version regression\n2026-11-03T17:28:01Z CLAIM FILE_cli_test_ceri_evidence_store.test.ts owner=codex-root branch=v1/v112-wp1101-integration scope=WP-1105 RC2 provenance version regression\n2026-11-03T17:28:38Z CLAIM FILE_cli_test_ceri_e2e.test.ts owner=codex-root branch=v1/v112-wp1101-integration scope=WP-1105 CERI version provenance regression test\n2026-11-03T17:28:58Z CLAIM SUITE owner=codex-root branch=v1/v112-wp1101-integration scope=WP-1105 CERI harnessVersion regression test RED\n2026-11-03T17:31:27Z SUITE_SCOPE RC2 full source gate after CERI provenance correction; log=/tmp/v112-rc2-make-test-post-ceri.log\n2026-11-03T18:19:43Z RELEASE SUITE owner=codex-root branch=v1/v112-wp1101-integration result=Corrected RC2 make test PASS 2314/0/5, security gates PASS; suite SHA-256 39cad26938be30dbb4b073a4d93e62a80aa920789e751cccba5465795eb362bd; updated doc security log SHA-256 a9ebd74bcb62e98376fa5a1779172f815a0a80ec23af0b26b3c72e8732391180\n2026-11-03T18:21:48Z RELEASE V112_RC2_VERSION_BUMP owner=codex-root branch=v1/v112-wp1101-integration result=committed e134dcd5 after reviewer approval and green RC2 source gates\n2026-11-03T18:21:48Z RELEASE FILE_package.json owner=codex-root branch=v1/v112-wp