{"timestamp":"2026-11-03T19:38:39.132Z","ordinal":78846,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0fd4138577b17921016aea38375c0c81a3a2f7831136fb2111","status":"completed","call_id":"call_d19fa55aa9da421ea381afeabd855fd2","name":"exec","input":"const patch=\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1101-integration/docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md\\n@@\\n ## Historical RC1 artifact (not release-qualified)\\n \\n-The exact release candidate distribution archive was built using the approved digest-pinned Bookworm builder (`rust:1.95.0-bookworm@sha256:4c2fd73ef19c5ef9d54bee03b06b2839a392604fbfcd578ed948b71b37c1d7fb`):\\n+The historical RC1 distribution archive was built using the approved digest-pinned Bookworm builder (`rust:1.95.0-bookworm@sha256:4c2fd73ef19c5ef9d54bee03b06b2839a392604fbfcd578ed948b71b37c1d7fb`):\\n@@\\n   - **Candidate Benchmark Acceptance Evidence:**\\n   - `docs/evidence/v1/wp-1103-g1.1-2/acceptance-28d79f3b0f4d.json`\\n   - Manifest SHA-256: `05ee2fa33ae5f6d6afc35df2e003c913de3f7bf0f817d2f76c709c16fb640d43`\\n+\\n+## RC2 exact archive (local qualification; unpublished)\\n+\\n+The first local RC2 archive (`fd99bd3f…`) inherited a group-writable evaluator helper from the shared-permission worktree. Its installed acceptance correctly refused to run. It was superseded and no release files were published. The final archive below uses the helper's Git-tracked mode `0644`; no tracked source content changed.\\n+\\n+- **Package Archive:** `nexus-linux-x86_64-v1.1.2-rc.2.tar.gz`\\n+  - **SHA-256 Digest:** `3e39bd36f31ddd706283febe88b4ecf55cc73c08607c568ca37acd9e9a57fa8b`\\n+  - **Size:** 5,389,945 bytes\\n+  - **Source Revision:** `e134dcd5103446f97e341059b54d85883e4c52fd`\\n+  - **Build Images:** Rust `1.95.0-bookworm` and Node `24.22.2-bookworm-slim`, both pinned by digest\\n+  - **Reproducibility:** two independent package runs produced byte-identical archives and matching checksums, SBOM, notices, compatibility metadata, and installer.\\n+  - **Installer:** local HTTP-feed installation passed archive checksum, package manifest, binary self-test, and compatibility checks. The installed launcher and TUI report `1.1.2-rc.2`; `.provenance.json` binds the installed tree to this archive digest. GitHub attestation verification was disabled because this local candidate is unpublished.\\n+  - **Internal component SHA-256:** launcher `320d7dc1603d30f863a9560a9101ab3fe1a57f164b7119c49e01d9ace40792c4`; CLI bundle `b35396a1814a54e896b620edfa8abef8b9890352ea66c927b3c3851a87dd51da`; core binary `5a3ca7e8e9878bc8aec0e391e9e082372f03b678a7c6c0f3d86753211f97cc84`.\\n+- **CycloneDX SBOM:** `sbom.cdx.json`, 141 components (119 Cargo, 20 npm, and root product); SHA-256 `e44dfa6cd62d670a359a6b45c04ce86cc61e31ab400396adc2197fae9d4cfcb2`.\\n+- **Installed package acceptance:** `eval/package_runtime.test.mjs` passed 5/5 on the exact archive, including installed evaluator execution outside the checkout and a candidate launch without mounting evaluator code. Test log SHA-256 `2d1f6edbb7ddb12883564e7dc71d4e42c1dfac7548495d00063e7f0100303f76`.\\n+- **Dataset boundary evidence:** [`acceptance-3e39bd36f31d.json`](../evidence/v1.1.2/acceptance-3e39bd36f31d.json), SHA-256 `37c7fcee8d1058d04a90f672b5949fbaee7710bc22677612036da140dc4cc176`. The fixture submitted all six public benchmark tasks once, captured six requests, and found no hidden validator path or command in prompts. It returns a generic completion, so hidden validators are false by design and this does not measure task-solving quality.\\n+- **Installed-package smoke evidence:** [`acceptance-3e39bd36f31d-installed.json`](../evidence/v1.1.2/acceptance-3e39bd36f31d-installed.json), same candidate archive and evidence SHA-256 `37c7fcee8d1058d04a90f672b5949fbaee7710bc22677612036da140dc4cc176`.\\n@@\\n-- [ ] All WP-1101–WP-1108 acceptance evidence and test suites are bound to the final candidate.\\n+- [x] WP-1101–WP-1108 source acceptance and test suites are bound to exact commit `e134dcd5103446f97e341059b54d85883e4c52fd`; package acceptance is bound to archive `3e39bd36…` where required.\\n - [ ] Current v1.1.2 roadmap items and release gates are qualified on the final candidate.\\n@@\\n-- [ ] Release scans, package checksums, SBOM, installer behavior, and reproducibility verified for the final archive.\\n-- [ ] CLI option compatibility and installed-candidate acceptance verified for the final archive.\\n-- [ ] Acceptance evidence and qualification record committed for the final candidate.\\n+- [x] Package checksums, SBOM, installer behavior, and reproducibility verified for the final archive.\\n+- [x] Packaged CLI evaluator options and installed-candidate acceptance verified for the final archive.\\n+- [ ] External CI/CodeQL and the supported-provider constrained-decoding matrix are attached to the final candidate.\\n+- [ ] Acceptance evidence and qualification record committed for the final candidate.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","create_time":1793734711.361629}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-03T19:38:39.219Z","ordinal":78847,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-d584e6e6-247a-4c88-a676-c9447516acec","changes":{"/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1101-integration/docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -46,3 +46,3 @@\n \n-The exact release candidate distribution archive was built using the approved digest-pinned Bookworm builder (`rust:1.95.0-bookworm@sha256:4c2fd73ef19c5ef9d54bee03b06b2839a392604fbfcd578ed948b71b37c1d7fb`):\n+The historical RC1 distribution archive was built using the approved digest-pinned Bookworm builder (`rust:1.95.0-bookworm@sha256:4c2fd73ef19c5ef9d54bee03b06b2839a392604fbfcd578ed948b71b37c1d7fb`):\n \n@@ -66,5 +66,22 @@\n \n+## RC2 exact archive (local qualification; unpublished)\n+\n+The first local RC2 archive (`fd99bd3f…`) inherited a group-writable evaluator helper from the shared-permission worktree. Its installed acceptance correctly refused to run. It was superseded and no release files were published. The final archive below uses the helper's Git-tracked mode `0644`; no tracked source content changed.\n+\n+- **Package Archive:** `nexus-linux-x86_64-v1.1.2-rc.2.tar.gz`\n+  - **SHA-256 Digest:** `3e39bd36f31ddd706283febe88b4ecf55cc73c08607c568ca37acd9e9a57fa8b`\n+  - **Size:** 5,389,945 bytes\n+  - **Source Revision:** `e134dcd5103446f97e341059b54d85883e4c52fd`\n+  - **Build Images:** Rust `1.95.0-bookworm` and Node `24.22.2-bookworm-slim`, both pinned by digest\n+  - **Reproducibility:** two independent package runs produced byte-identical archives and matching checksums, SBOM, notices, compatibility metadata, and installer.\n+  - **Installer:** local HTTP-feed installation passed archive checksum, package manifest, binary self-test, and compatibility checks. The installed launcher and TUI report `1.1.2-rc.2`; `.provenance.json` binds the installed tree to this archive digest. GitHub attestation verification was disabled because this local candidate is unpublished.\n+  - **Internal component SHA-256:** launcher `320d7dc1603d30f863a9560a9101ab3fe1a57f164b7119c49e01d9ace40792c4`; CLI bundle `b35396a1814a54e896b620edfa8abef8b9890352ea66c927b3c3851a87dd51da`; core binary `5a3ca7e8e9878bc8aec0e391e9e082372f03b678a7c6c0f3d86753211f97cc84`.\n+- **CycloneDX SBOM:** `sbom.cdx.json`, 141 components (119 Cargo, 20 npm, and root product); SHA-256 `e44dfa6cd62d670a359a6b45c04ce86cc61e31ab400396adc2197fae9d4cfcb2`.\n+- **Installed package acceptance:** `eval/package_runtime.test.mjs` passed 5/5 on the exact archive, including installed evaluator execution outside the checkout and a candidate launch without mounting evaluator code. Test log SHA-256 `2d1f6edbb7ddb12883564e7dc71d4e42c1dfac7548495d00063e7f0100303f76`.\n+- **Dataset boundary evidence:** [`acceptance-3e39bd36f31d.json`](../evidence/v1.1.2/acceptance-3e39bd36f31d.json), SHA-256 `37c7fcee8d1058d04a90f672b5949fbaee7710bc22677612036da140dc4cc176`. The fixture submitted all six public benchmark tasks once, captured six requests, and found no hidden validator path or command in prompts. It returns a generic completion, so hidden validators are false by design and this does not measure task-solving quality.\n+- **Installed-package smoke evidence:** [`acceptance-3e39bd36f31d-installed.json`](../evidence/v1.1.2/acceptance-3e39bd36f31d-installed.json), same candidate archive and evidence SHA-256 `37c7fcee8d1058d04a90f672b5949fbaee7710bc22677612036da140dc4cc176`.\n+\n ## Exact-candidate release checklist\n \n-- [ ] All WP-1101–WP-1108 acceptance evidence and test suites are bound to the final candidate.\n+- [x] WP-1101–WP-1108 source acceptance and test suites are bound to exact commit `e134dcd5103446f97e341059b54d85883e4c52fd`; package acceptance is bound to archive `3e39bd36…` where required.\n - [ ] Current v1.1.2 roadmap items and release gates are qualified on the final candidate.\n@@ -72,4 +89,5 @@\n - [x] Corrected RC2 full source suite, security scans, and type build passed on exact clean commit `e134dcd5103446f97e341059b54d85883e4c52fd`.\n-- [ ] Release scans, package checksums, SBOM, installer behavior, and reproducibility verified for the final archive.\n-- [ ] CLI option compatibility and installed-candidate acceptance verified for the final archive.\n+- [x] Package checksums, SBOM, installer behavior, and reproducibility verified for the final archive.\n+- [x] Packaged CLI evaluator options and installed-candidate acceptance verified for the final archive.\n+- [ ] External CI/CodeQL and the supported-provider constrained-decoding matrix are attached to the final candidate.\n - [ ] Acceptance evidence and qualification record committed for the final candidate.\n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1101-integration/docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1793734719216,"completed_at_ms":1793734719219}}
