{"timestamp":"2026-11-03T19:39:16.444Z","ordinal":78873,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0fd4138577b17921016aea385e352881a3a8a6de17062d6b86","status":"completed","call_id":"call_a52554681aa7480c85c1bb935c7da3af","name":"exec","input":"const patch=\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1101-integration/docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md\\n@@\\n-| WP-1103 — Versioned evaluation datasets | Versioned datasets with separate examples/oracles and regression/benchmark splits; candidate prompts cannot access oracles. | Integrated in commit `11f41ed0`. Exact RC2 archive acceptance invoked all six public benchmark tasks once through a loopback provider and confirmed hidden oracle paths and commands were absent from captured prompts. | **PASSED — dataset boundary** | Dataset manifest SHA-256 `05ee2fa33ae5f6d6afc35df2e003c913de3f7bf0f817d2f76c709c16fb640d43`. Exact archive evidence: [`acceptance-3e39bd36f31d.json`](../evidence/v1.1.2/acceptance-3e39bd36f31d.json), archive SHA-256 `3e39bd36f31ddd706283febe88b4ecf55cc73c08607c568ca37acd9e9a57fa8b`. The deterministic fixture only reports task completion; hidden validators intentionally remain false, so this is not task-solving or provider-quality evidence. |\\n-| WP-1104 — Standalone `nexus eval` | Packaged command supports dataset selection, run count, isolated home, and structured score output. | Exact RC2 installed package ran the versioned evaluator outside the checkout and launched a candidate without mounting evaluator code. | **PASSED — package runtime** | [`eval/package_runtime.test.mjs`](../evidence/v1.1.2/acceptance-3e39bd36f31d-installed.json) passed 5/5 tests on the exact archive with isolated HOME and a deterministic loopback provider; test log SHA-256 `2d1f6edbb7ddb12883564e7dc71d4e42c1dfac7548495d00063e7f0100303f76`. |\\n+| WP-1103 — Versioned evaluation datasets | Versioned datasets with separate examples/oracles and regression/benchmark splits; candidate prompts cannot access oracles. | Integrated in commit `11f41ed0`. Exact RC2 archive acceptance invoked all six public benchmark tasks once through a loopback provider and confirmed hidden oracle paths and commands were absent from captured prompts. | **PASSED — dataset boundary** | Dataset manifest SHA-256 `05ee2fa33ae5f6d6afc35df2e003c913de3f7bf0f817d2f76c709c16fb640d43`. Exact archive evidence: [`acceptance-3e39bd36f31d-installed.json`](../evidence/v1.1.2/acceptance-3e39bd36f31d-installed.json), archive SHA-256 `3e39bd36f31ddd706283febe88b4ecf55cc73c08607c568ca37acd9e9a57fa8b`. The deterministic fixture only reports task completion; hidden validators intentionally remain false, so this is not task-solving or provider-quality evidence. |\\n+| WP-1104 — Standalone `nexus eval` | Packaged command supports dataset selection, run count, isolated home, and structured score output. | Exact RC2 installed package ran the versioned evaluator outside the checkout and launched a candidate without mounting evaluator code. | **PASSED — package runtime** | Package acceptance passed 5/5 tests with isolated HOME and the exact archive; test log SHA-256 `2d1f6edbb7ddb12883564e7dc71d4e42c1dfac7548495d00063e7f0100303f76`. The same candidate-bound evidence file is linked in WP-1103. |\\n@@\\n-- **Dataset boundary evidence:** [`acceptance-3e39bd36f31d.json`](../evidence/v1.1.2/acceptance-3e39bd36f31d.json), SHA-256 `37c7fcee8d1058d04a90f672b5949fbaee7710bc22677612036da140dc4cc176`. The fixture submitted all six public benchmark tasks once, captured six requests, and found no hidden validator path or command in prompts. It returns a generic completion, so hidden validators are false by design and this does not measure task-solving quality.\\n-- **Installed-package smoke evidence:** [`acceptance-3e39bd36f31d-installed.json`](../evidence/v1.1.2/acceptance-3e39bd36f31d-installed.json), same candidate archive and evidence SHA-256 `37c7fcee8d1058d04a90f672b5949fbaee7710bc22677612036da140dc4cc176`.\\n+- **Installed-candidate evidence:** [`acceptance-3e39bd36f31d-installed.json`](../evidence/v1.1.2/acceptance-3e39bd36f31d-installed.json), SHA-256 `37c7fcee8d1058d04a90f672b5949fbaee7710bc22677612036da140dc4cc176`. The deterministic fixture submitted all six public benchmark tasks once, captured six requests, and found no hidden validator path or command in prompts. It returns a generic completion, so hidden validators are false by design and this does not measure task-solving quality. The same full run passed all five package-runtime tests.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","create_time":1793734750.2092435}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-03T19:39:16.472Z","ordinal":78874,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-7fd7e2dd-144c-471c-a231-77cd8c5118a8","changes":{"/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1101-integration/docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -27,4 +27,4 @@\n | WP-1102 — Flight recorder credential redaction | Zero-leak sanitization across traces, CLI errors, and debug journals. | Integrated in commit `9c1926e1`. Comprehensive regex + token redactor applied across all flight recorder sinks. | **PASSED** | Validated in `cli/test/*_redaction.test.ts` (22/22 passed across all sinks and adversarial fixtures). |\n-| WP-1103 — Versioned evaluation datasets | Versioned datasets with separate examples/oracles and regression/benchmark splits; candidate prompts cannot access oracles. | Integrated in commit `11f41ed0`. Exact RC2 archive acceptance invoked all six public benchmark tasks once through a loopback provider and confirmed hidden oracle paths and commands were absent from captured prompts. | **PASSED — dataset boundary** | Dataset manifest SHA-256 `05ee2fa33ae5f6d6afc35df2e003c913de3f7bf0f817d2f76c709c16fb640d43`. Exact archive evidence: [`acceptance-3e39bd36f31d.json`](../evidence/v1.1.2/acceptance-3e39bd36f31d.json), archive SHA-256 `3e39bd36f31ddd706283febe88b4ecf55cc73c08607c568ca37acd9e9a57fa8b`. The deterministic fixture only reports task completion; hidden validators intentionally remain false, so this is not task-solving or provider-quality evidence. |\n-| WP-1104 — Standalone `nexus eval` | Packaged command supports dataset selection, run count, isolated home, and structured score output. | Exact RC2 installed package ran the versioned evaluator outside the checkout and launched a candidate without mounting evaluator code. | **PASSED — package runtime** | [`eval/package_runtime.test.mjs`](../evidence/v1.1.2/acceptance-3e39bd36f31d-installed.json) passed 5/5 tests on the exact archive with isolated HOME and a deterministic loopback provider; test log SHA-256 `2d1f6edbb7ddb12883564e7dc71d4e42c1dfac7548495d00063e7f0100303f76`. |\n+| WP-1103 — Versioned evaluation datasets | Versioned datasets with separate examples/oracles and regression/benchmark splits; candidate prompts cannot access oracles. | Integrated in commit `11f41ed0`. Exact RC2 archive acceptance invoked all six public benchmark tasks once through a loopback provider and confirmed hidden oracle paths and commands were absent from captured prompts. | **PASSED — dataset boundary** | Dataset manifest SHA-256 `05ee2fa33ae5f6d6afc35df2e003c913de3f7bf0f817d2f76c709c16fb640d43`. Exact archive evidence: [`acceptance-3e39bd36f31d-installed.json`](../evidence/v1.1.2/acceptance-3e39bd36f31d-installed.json), archive SHA-256 `3e39bd36f31ddd706283febe88b4ecf55cc73c08607c568ca37acd9e9a57fa8b`. The deterministic fixture only reports task completion; hidden validators intentionally remain false, so this is not task-solving or provider-quality evidence. |\n+| WP-1104 — Standalone `nexus eval` | Packaged command supports dataset selection, run count, isolated home, and structured score output. | Exact RC2 installed package ran the versioned evaluator outside the checkout and launched a candidate without mounting evaluator code. | **PASSED — package runtime** | Package acceptance passed 5/5 tests with isolated HOME and the exact archive; test log SHA-256 `2d1f6edbb7ddb12883564e7dc71d4e42c1dfac7548495d00063e7f0100303f76`. The same candidate-bound evidence file is linked in WP-1103. |\n | WP-1105 — Deterministic code evaluators | Modular AST, build, typecheck, diff-boundary, and JSON-repair evaluators. | Integrated in commit `e2bacf1a`. Deterministic evaluators wired into runner and scorer. | **PASSED** | Validated in `cli/test/code_evaluators.test.ts` (9/9 passed). |\n@@ -80,4 +80,3 @@\n - **Installed package acceptance:** `eval/package_runtime.test.mjs` passed 5/5 on the exact archive, including installed evaluator execution outside the checkout and a candidate launch without mounting evaluator code. Test log SHA-256 `2d1f6edbb7ddb12883564e7dc71d4e42c1dfac7548495d00063e7f0100303f76`.\n-- **Dataset boundary evidence:** [`acceptance-3e39bd36f31d.json`](../evidence/v1.1.2/acceptance-3e39bd36f31d.json), SHA-256 `37c7fcee8d1058d04a90f672b5949fbaee7710bc22677612036da140dc4cc176`. The fixture submitted all six public benchmark tasks once, captured six requests, and found no hidden validator path or command in prompts. It returns a generic completion, so hidden validators are false by design and this does not measure task-solving quality.\n-- **Installed-package smoke evidence:** [`acceptance-3e39bd36f31d-installed.json`](../evidence/v1.1.2/acceptance-3e39bd36f31d-installed.json), same candidate archive and evidence SHA-256 `37c7fcee8d1058d04a90f672b5949fbaee7710bc22677612036da140dc4cc176`.\n+- **Installed-candidate evidence:** [`acceptance-3e39bd36f31d-installed.json`](../evidence/v1.1.2/acceptance-3e39bd36f31d-installed.json), SHA-256 `37c7fcee8d1058d04a90f672b5949fbaee7710bc22677612036da140dc4cc176`. The deterministic fixture submitted all six public benchmark tasks once, captured six requests, and found no hidden validator path or command in prompts. It returns a generic completion, so hidden validators are false by design and this does not measure task-solving quality. The same full run passed all five package-runtime tests.\n \n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1101-integration/docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1793734756471,"completed_at_ms":1793734756472}}
