{"timestamp":"2026-11-03T19:41:55.469Z","ordinal":78973,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0fd4138577b17921016aea390081a481a3874bca48fa788ac3","status":"completed","call_id":"call_34d5be0ff25f487cb5195d0bd28de857","name":"exec","input":"const r=await tools.mcp__mcp_search__work_state_write({list:\"v1.1.2-release\",fields:{task:\"RC2 exact-source artifact and qualification\",status:\"doing\",phase:\"peer review of final package evidence\",gate:\"Exact e134dcd5 source make test 2314/0/5 and make build PASS. Two digest-pinned canonical-mode builds byte-identical archive SHA-256 3e39bd36f31ddd706283febe88b4ecf55cc73c08607c568ca37acd9e9a57fa8b. Local installer PASS. eval/package_runtime.test.mjs 5/5 PASS, log SHA-256 2d1f6edbb7ddb12883564e7dc71d4e42c1dfac7548495d00063e7f0100303f76. Security gates PASS ba472bb0....\",evidence:\"docs/evidence/v1.1.2/acceptance-3e39bd36f31d-installed.json SHA-256 37c7fcee8d1058d04a90f672b5949fbaee7710bc22677612036da140dc4cc176. Qualification record updated; /root/review_delta independent review pending.\",next:\"Address review comments, commit exact artifact/acceptance qualification evidence, then reconcile outstanding provider-matrix, external CI/CodeQL, and owner publication steps.\",friction:\"G1.1-4 supported-provider 99.5% JSON metric remains pending because GATEWAY is held by the separate RC15 stream. External CI/CodeQL and release publication remain outside local candidate qualification.\",heartbeat:\"2026-11-03T20:02:00Z\",claim:\"FILE_docs_releases_v1.1.2-qualification.md and FILE_docs_evidence_v1.1.2_acceptance_3e39bd36f31d_installed.json held; source/package/SUITE claims released.\",retrieval:\"XERJ hit nexus-cli index.ts:1020 for eval endpoint option; helper mode issue traced to local Git mode 100644 vs worktree 0664; no implementation source changed.\"}});\ntext(r);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","create_time":1793734912.508129